msgid ""
"A graphical OSD simulation in a separate window can be opened by adding the "
"following option to sim_vehicle.py::"
msgstr "可通过向 sim_vehicle.py 添加以下选项来打开独立窗口中的图形化 OSD 仿真：:"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sitl-testing-osd.rst:38
#: c425e508b4df48b3b2eb9ae104b736fb
msgid "The simulated OSD can now be set and configured via parameters."
msgstr "仿真 OSD 现在可通过参数进行设置和配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sitl-testing-osd.rst:40
#: b13be7d70b49491486adddc135554031
msgid ""
"As above, by changing the OSD panel items' parameters, a live update of "
"their placement can be seen in this emulator."
msgstr "如上所述，通过修改 OSD 面板元素的参数，可在此仿真器中实时查看其位置变化。"

